=== reading the two numbers ===
Implementation alone (matched settings): ARI = 0.271
Settings and implementation together:   ARI = 0.091
-> The partitions disagree even at identical settings. With 12 samples the correlation matrix is estimated too imprecisely for module boundaries to be reproducible, so individual module membership here should not be treated as a finding.

